              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.32.28+NUM.32.29+NUM.32.30+NUM.32.31+NUM.32.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 32:28-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.18+DEU.3.19+DEU.3.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Poi 3:18-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.22.1+JOS.22.2+JOS.22.3+JOS.22.4+JOS.22.5+JOS.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoc 22:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yocuwa wacu ni Jurubeni, man ni Jugadi, man ni ng’et suru pa Manase, ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wupoi kum lembe ma Musa ma jatic pa Yehova ng’olo iwu, m’ewacu kumae, Yehova Mungu mu mio iwu yom, man ebimio ng’om maeni iwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mon mu, ku nyithindho mu ma thindho, ku lim mu, gibibedo i ng’om ma Musa mio iwu loka Yordan; ento wubikadhu lokaca i wang’ juwedu ku jamtho, dhanu ceke ma tek gi jurukara, man wubikonyogi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cil ma Yehova mio ko yom ni juwedu, calu emio iwu, man gin bende gimwonyo ng’om ma Yehova Mungu mu mio igi: ka wubilund dwogo i ng’om ma piny mu, e wubimwonye, ma Musa ma jatic pa Yehova mio iwu loka Yordan yo ku wokceng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E giloko lembe ni Yocuwa, giwacu kumae, Gin ceke m’ing’olo iwa wabitimo, man ka ceke ma tek iorowa wabicidho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Calu wawinjo ba Musa i gin ceke, wabiwinjo i beng’i kumeca: ento Yehova Mungu peri re bed kudi, calu naka ebedo ku Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu ma tek bijai kum lembang’ola peri, man ebiwinjo lembe peri ngo i gin ceke m’ing’olo ire, jubinege: ento ibed tek man ku tegocwiny ma ber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
